## Multi-Provider Strategy

### Khi nào sử dụng Provider nào

| Use Case | Recommended Provider |
|----------|---------------------|
| Code generation, assistance | **Claude** (Opus/Sonnet) |
| Fast, cost-effective tasks | **Gemini Flash** hoặc **GPT-3.5** |
| Complex reasoning, analysis | **Claude Opus** hoặc **GPT-4** |
| Multimodal (native vision) | **Gemini** |
| Long context (1M+ tokens) | **Gemini** |
| Enterprise GCP integration | **Gemini via Vertex AI** |
| Simple chat/completion | **GPT-3.5** hoặc **Haiku** |
| Function calling (structured) | **OpenAI** hoặc **Gemini** |

### Multi-Provider Abstraction

```typescript
// lib/llm-factory.ts
interface LLMConfig {
  provider: 'openai' | 'gemini' | 'claude';
  model?: string;
  temperature?: number;
  maxTokens?: number;
}

interface LLMResponse {
  content: string;
  provider: string;
  model: string;
  usage?: { input: number; output: number };
}

class LLMFactory {
  private openaiService = new ChatService();
  private geminiService = new GeminiTextService();
  private claudeService = new ClaudeTextService();

  async complete(prompt: string, config: LLMConfig): Promise<LLMResponse> {
    switch (config.provider) {
      case 'openai': {
        const response = await this.openaiService.createChat([
          { role: 'user', content: prompt, name: undefined, function_call: undefined }
        ], { model: config.model as any, temperature: config.temperature, maxTokens: config.maxTokens });
        return {
          content: response.choices[0].message.content || '',
          provider: 'openai',
          model: response.model,
          usage: { input: response.usage?.prompt_tokens || 0, output: response.usage?.completion_tokens || 0 }
        };
      }
      case 'gemini': {
        const content = await this.geminiService.generateText(prompt, { model: config.model as any, maxTokens: config.maxTokens });
        return { content, provider: 'gemini', model: config.model || 'gemini-1.5-pro' };
      }
      case 'claude': {
        const content = await this.claudeService.generateText(prompt, undefined, { model: config.model as any, maxTokens: config.maxTokens, temperature: config.temperature });
        return { content, provider: 'claude', model: config.model || 'claude-sonnet-4' };
      }
    }
  }

  async chat(messages: any[], config: LLMConfig): Promise<LLMResponse> {
    switch (config.provider) {
      case 'openai': {
        const response = await this.openaiService.createChat(messages, { model: config.model as any });
        return { content: response.choices[0].message.content || '', provider: 'openai', model: response.model };
      }
      case 'gemini': {
        const content = await this.geminiService.generateText(messages[messages.length - 1].content);
        return { content, provider: 'gemini', model: config.model || 'gemini-1.5-pro' };
      }
      case 'claude': {
        const content = await this.claudeService.chat(messages);
        return { content, provider: 'claude', model: config.model || 'claude-sonnet-4' };
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### Fallback Strategy

```typescript
// lib/llm-fallback.ts
class LLMWithFallback {
  constructor(
    private primary: LLMFactory,
    private fallback: LLMFactory,
    private costTracker: CostTrackingService
  ) {}

  async complete(prompt: string, config: LLMConfig): Promise<LLMResponse> {
    try {
      if (!this.costTracker.canMakeRequest()) {
        console.warn('Primary provider budget exceeded, using fallback');
        return this.fallback.complete(prompt, config);
      }
      return await this.primary.complete(prompt, config);
    } catch (error) {
      console.warn('Primary provider failed, using fallback:', error);
      return this.fallback.complete(prompt, config);
    }
  }
}
```

